# Repository language statistics
#
# The shipped firmware is C: the out-of-tree Zephyr application under app/src/,
# plus the QBOOT and Zephyr upstream trees (quilla/, appliance/, modules/) that
# are deliberately NOT tracked in this repository -- they stay independent,
# pullable clones (see .gitignore and README.md "Layout").
#
# The two Python files under tools/ are host-side helpers (binary-contract
# checker and factory image packer), not firmware. Because those helpers are
# larger than the tracked C sources, GitHub otherwise labels this repository
# "Python". Keep them out of the language statistics rather than relabelling
# them as C: the language bar should reflect the product code, not its tooling.
#
# Linguist applies this override only after .gitattributes is committed.
tools/*.py -linguist-detectable
